  "notes": {
    "s-handoff": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "For the AI building the app: copy every artboard exactly (layout, spacing, sizes, fonts, colors, radius, dashed tear lines, stamps, icons, text). The canvas shows light mode only: build dark mode from the dark tokens in the prompt, same layout. Sample posts, names, and numbers are demo data. Build both the desktop and the phone artboard of every page.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 620
    },
    "s-idea": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "Direction v2: Notice Slips. The app looks like Dushanbe’s paper notice boards, made digital. Every post is a slip pinned to a dotted board, with tear-off contact tabs at the bottom (Write · Call · Save). Resolved and expired posts get a rubber stamp. Type: Unbounded for headings, Onest for text (both have Cyrillic). The first design stays in its own canvas for comparison.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 0
    },
